pywhat/Data/file_signatures.json
--------------------------------
Derived from the Wikipedia article "List of file signatures" by its contributors:
  https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_file_signatures
  revision 1021969603 of 2021-05-07:
  https://en.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=List_of_file_signatures&oldid=1021969603
  authors: https://en.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=List_of_file_signatures&action=history
Changes: scripts/get_file_sigs.py converted the article's table to JSON on 2021-05-09
(commit 9a7d21d). An earlier YAML version (2021-04-01, commit 125d654) was converted from
revision 1011793547 of 2021-03-12. In 2026 (#275), the byte order marks of big-endian UTF-16
and UTF-32 were added and the descriptions of the little-endian ones were corrected.

